      "message": "Please notice putting GPIO_SEL_1P8V in flags parameter of gpio_set_flags_by_mask() is crucial. It will set the corresponding bits in LV_GPIO_CTL. Or those bits in LV_GPIO_CTL are cleared unexpectedly and influences the i2c ports which support 1.8V.",
